`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java` — MapStruct interface. `toOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` ignores `id` and `pets`. `toOwnerDto(Owner)` runs a chain of `@AfterMapping` enrichers that add derived, presentation-only fields: `displayName` ("Last, First"), `initials`, `checkDigit` (Luhn over customerCode), `membershipNumber`, `membershipPoints`/`membershipLevel`, `contactPreference` (EMAIL/PHONE), `locality` (region from customerCode), `ageBand`. The controller then overlays `bulkSignupWarning` via `withBulkSignupWarning`.

Derived-value logic those mappers call lives on the entity `Owner`: `getIdentityKey`, `getCheckDigit`, `getMembershipPoints`/`getMembershipLevel`, `getAgeBand`, `getTelephoneDisplay` (all quoted in the `Owner.java` read above).

